B.aaW=new A.m(1,"\ud83c\udf17","I follow you all day long and stretch out tall at sunset, but I vanish the moment the lights go out. What am I?","shadow",B.k,"Stand in the sun and look down.")
B.aa9=new A.m(2,"\ud83d\udce3","Say anything at all to me and I say it right back \u2014 and I have no mouth. What am I?","echo",B.k,"Shout it across a valley.")
B.a1Z=s(["watch"],t.s)
B.a9l=new A.m(3,"\u23f0","I have two hands and a face, but no arms and no eyes. What am I?","clock",B.a1Z,"It ticks on the wall.")
B.a9r=new A.m(4,"\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f","The longer I stand and work, the shorter I get \u2014 and I die in my own light. What am I?","candle",B.k,"You blow it out on a birthday cake.")
B.ad7=new A.m(5,"\ud83e\udd5a","White on the outside, gold in the middle. Crack me and breakfast begins. What am I?","egg",B.k,"A hen made it.")
B.ab5=new A.m(6,"\ud83e\uddfd","I am full of holes, yet I hold water better than anything in the kitchen. What am I?","sponge",B.k,"It lives beside the sink.")
B.a9X=new A.m(7,"\ud83e\ude9e","I show you yourself the wrong way round, and I never once lie. What am I?","mirror",B.k,"On the bathroom wall.")
B.acX=new A.m(8,"\ud83e\uddfb","The more I dry, the wetter I get. What am I?","towel",B.k,"You reach for it after a shower.")
B.ZD=s(["footprints","steps"],t.s)
B.a8M=new A.m(9,"\ud83d\udc63","The more of me you take, the more you leave behind. What am I?","footsteps",B.ZD,"Walk on wet sand, then look back.")
B.ad1=new A.m(10,"\ud83e\udd2b","Tell me to one person and I may survive. Tell me to two and I am already gone. What am I?","secret",B.k,"Shhh \u2014 do not tell anyone.")
B.acY=new A.m(11,"\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f","I have cities with no houses, rivers with no water and mountains with no rock. What am I?","map",B.k,"Unfold it before a road trip.")
B.a8W=new A.m(12,"\ud83e\udea1","I have an eye but cannot see, and I am useless without my thread. What am I?","needle",B.k,"A tailor keeps a box of them.")
B.a9J=new A.m(13,"\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f","I have a mouth but never eat, and a bed but never sleep. What am I?","river",B.k,"It runs all the way to the sea.")
B.a8X=new A.m(14,"\ud83d\udcd6","I have a spine and hundreds of leaves, but I am no tree. What am I?","book",B.k,"A library is stacked with them.")
B.a97=new A.m(15,"\ud83e\uddc5","I come in layers, and the braver you are with a knife the more you cry. What am I?","onion",B.k,"It goes in almost every curry.")
B.abl=new A.m(16,"\ud83d\udcee","I travel the whole world over while sitting in one tiny corner. What am I?","stamp",B.k,"Lick it and stick it on an envelope.")
B.a9Y=new A.m(17,"\ud83d\udd25","Feed me and I grow tall; give me a drink and I die. What am I?","fire",B.k,"Do not touch \u2014 it is hot.")
B.a8z=new A.m(18,"\ud83d\udca8","You cannot see me or catch me, but you can feel me, and I can push a whole ship along. What am I?","wind",B.k,"It fills a sail.")
B.a9a=new A.m(19,"\u2601\ufe0f","I drift all day without wings and cry without eyes. What am I?","cloud",B.k,"Look up just before the rain.")
B.a8V=new A.m(20,"\ud83c\udf08","I am an arch of seven colours that only turns up after the sky has had a good cry. What am I?","rainbow",B.k,"Sunshine plus rain.")
B.ac9=new A.m(21,"\ud83c\udf19","I come out at night without being called and disappear by day without being stolen. What am I?","moon",B.k,"It changes shape every night.")
B.acB=new A.m(22,"\u2744\ufe0f","I fall without ever being hurt, and I turn the whole world white. What am I?","snow",B.k,"Winter, and a carrot for a nose.")
B.abZ=new A.m(23,"\ud83e\ude91","I have four legs but cannot walk a step, and I am happiest when you sit on me. What am I?","chair",B.k,"There is one at every dinner table.")
B.aah=new A.m(24,"\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f","I have a head and a foot, but no body at all. What am I?","bed",B.k,"You meet it every night.")
B.abv=new A.m(25,"\ud83c\udf3d","I am covered in ears but cannot hear a word. What am I?","corn",B.k,"Heat it up and it pops.")
B.aam=new A.m(26,"\ud83e\udd54","I have eyes but never see, and everyone cheers when I am fried. What am I?","potato",B.k,"Chips are made of it.")
B.abO=new A.m(27,"\ud83d\udc5f","I have a tongue and a sole, but I never speak and I never sing. What am I?","shoe",B.k,"They come in pairs.")
B.ac3=new A.m(28,"\ud83d\udc88","I have a mouth full of teeth and have never bitten a soul. What am I?","comb",B.k,"It runs through your hair.")
B.acv=new A.m(29,"\ud83c\udfb9","I have dozens of keys and open no doors at all. What am I?","piano",B.k,"Black keys, white keys, one tune.")
B.aaG=new A.m(30,"\ud83c\udf7e","I have a neck but no head, and I am at my best when I am full. What am I?","bottle",B.k,"Water comes in one.")
B.ab2=new A.m(31,"\u2602\ufe0f","I open up the moment the sky does. What am I?","umbrella",B.k,"Grab it on a wet morning.")
B.a8C=new A.m(32,"\ud83e\ude9c","I have steps but no legs, and I take you up without moving myself. What am I?","ladder",B.k,"For the top shelf, or a painter.")
B.acm=new A.m(33,"\ud83c\udf09","I stand over the water and let you cross without getting your feet wet. What am I?","bridge",B.k,"It joins two banks.")
B.aan=new A.m(34,"\ud83d\udd11","I am small and metal, I turn once, and the door is yours. What am I?","key",B.k,"It lives in a lock, or a pocket.")
B.acg=new A.m(35,"\u270f\ufe0f","The more I am used the shorter I get, and I wear a little rubber hat. What am I?","pencil",B.k,"Sharpen it and write.")
B.acR=new A.m(36,"\u2709\ufe0f","I am full of words but have no voice, and I travel in a paper coat. What am I?","letter",B.k,"The postman brings it.")
B.a8y=new A.m(37,"\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f","It belongs to you, and yet everyone else uses it far more than you do. What is it?","name",B.k,"It is the first thing on your ID card.")
B.a9w=new A.m(38,"\ud83d\udcc5","I am always on my way and I never actually arrive. What am I?","tomorrow",B.k,"The day after this one.")
B.abT=new A.m(39,"\ud83e\udd10","Say my name out loud and you have already broken me. What am I?","silence",B.k,"The opposite of noise.")
B.YZ=s(["dark"],t.s)
B.acZ=new A.m(40,"\ud83c\udf11","The more of me there is, the less you can see. What am I?","darkness",B.YZ,"Switch the light off.")
B.ac2=new A.m(41,"\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f","The more you take away from me, the bigger I become. What am I?","hole",B.k,"A shovel makes one.")
B.a8x=new A.m(42,"\ud83d\udcad","I visit you with your eyes shut and I am gone by breakfast. What am I?","dream",B.k,"It happens while you sleep.")
B.aaH=new A.m(43,"\ud83e\udd1d","You can make me, give me and break me, but you can never touch me. What am I?","promise",B.k,"Keep it, and people trust you.")
B.acJ=new A.m(44,"\ud83d\udc0c","I carry my house on my back and I am in absolutely no hurry. What am I?","snail",B.k,"Slow, and a bit slimy.")
B.a9x=new A.m(45,"\ud83d\udc18","I have a trunk and I am not a tree, and I never forget a thing. What am I?","elephant",B.k,"The biggest animal on land.")
B.abK=new A.m(46,"\ud83d\udc1d","I am small and stripy, I work all day, and I pay you in honey. What am I?","bee",B.k,"It buzzes around the flowers.")
B.acL=new A.m(47,"\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f","Eight legs, and I build my whole house out of thread. What am I?","spider",B.k,"Look in the corner of the ceiling.")
B.aai=new A.m(48,"\ud83d\udc27","I wear a tuxedo everywhere, I have two wings, and I cannot fly at all. What am I?","penguin",B.k,"It waddles about on the ice.")
B.a9S=new A.m(49,"\ud83d\udc19","I have eight arms, three hearts, and I change colour when I feel like it. What am I?","octopus",B.k,"It lives on the sea floor.")
B.a9T=new A.m(50,"\ud83e\ude81","I fly on the end of a string, and the ruder the wind the happier I am. What am I?","kite",B.k,"A spool of thread and an open sky.")
B.Z1=s(["die"],t.s)
B.a9Q=new A.m(51,"\ud83c\udfb2","I have six faces and twenty-one eyes, and I never make up my mind until I have tumbled. What am I?","dice",B.Z1,"Snakes and ladders needs one.")
B.ZN=s(["gloves","mitten"],t.s)
B.a9s=new A.m(52,"\ud83e\udde4","Five rooms, one hallway, and the only tenant who ever moves in is your own hand. What am I?","glove",B.ZN,"One for each hand in winter.")
B.ach=new A.m(53,"\u2693","Drop me and the ship stays put. Lift me and it is free to go. What am I?","anchor",B.k,"At the end of the ship's chain.")
B.a9F=new A.m(54,"\ud83e\uded6","I whistle when I am angry, and I am only ever angry when I am hot. What am I?","kettle",B.k,"Tea starts with it.")
B.a9m=new A.m(55,"\ud83c\udf05","I am a line you can walk towards your whole life and never once reach. What am I?","horizon",B.k,"Where the sea seems to meet the sky.")
B.abS=new A.m(56,"\ud83e\udd71","Nobody wants me, yet the moment one person has me, everyone in the room catches me. What am I?","yawn",B.k,"Late at night, hand over your mouth.")
B.aay=new A.m(57,"\ud83e\udded","My needle has no thread, and it trembles until it finds north. What am I?","compass",B.k,"A hiker keeps one in a pocket.")
B.ac6=new A.m(58,"\ud83c\udf44","I spring up overnight without a seed, I wear a hat but have no head, and I like it dark and damp. What am I?","mushroom",B.k,"Sliced onto a pizza.")
B.abj=new A.m(59,"\ud83e\uddf2","I pull without hands and hold without glue \u2014 but only iron ever listens to me. What am I?","magnet",B.k,"It keeps the note on the fridge.")
B.ab6=new A.m(60,"\ud83c\udf88","Fill me with your breath and I grow round and light. One pin, and I am gone with a bang. What am I?","balloon",B.k,"Tied to a chair at a birthday party.")
B.a09=s(["mist"],t.s)
B.aco=new A.m(61,"\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f","I am a cloud that lost its way and settled on the road, and even the headlights cannot see through me. What am I?","fog",B.a09,"Drive slowly on a winter morning.")
B.aaB=new A.m(62,"\ud83c\udf0a","Twice a day I come up the beach, and twice a day I leave \u2014 taking your sandcastle with me. What am I?","tide",B.k,"The moon pulls it in and out.")
B.aaY=new A.m(63,"\u26c8\ufe0f","I am the sky clearing its throat, and you always see my sister before you hear me. What am I?","thunder",B.k,"It follows the flash.")
B.ad6=new A.m(64,"\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f","I run through your fingers, I fill the hourglass, and I am what a mountain becomes when it grows old. What am I?","sand",B.k,"Between your toes at the beach.")
B.aal=new A.m(65,"\ud83c\udf0b","I am a mountain with a temper, and whole islands were born from my coughing. What am I?","volcano",B.k,"A mountain that smokes.")
B.a9M=new A.m(66,"\ud83e\uddd4","I grow on a face but never on a child's, and a barber charges to take me away. What am I?","beard",B.k,"Santa has a long white one.")
B.Yy=s(["bones"],t.s)
B.aaQ=new A.m(67,"\ud83e\uddb4","I am two hundred and six pieces hanging together, and you carry me everywhere without ever seeing me. What am I?","skeleton",B.Yy,"In the cupboard, in the saying.")
B.a_4=s(["heartbeat"],t.s)
B.ab9=new A.m(68,"\ud83d\udc93","Press two fingers to your wrist and I will tell you a secret in taps. What am I?","pulse",B.a_4,"The doctor counts it.")
B.Zz=s(["nought","nothing","0"],t.s)
B.ad8=new A.m(69,"0\ufe0f\u20e3","Stand me in front of a number and I am worth nothing. Stand me behind it and I make it ten times richer. What am I?","zero",B.Zz,"A round number, in every sense.")
B.a9P=new A.m(70,"\ud83d\udd24","Twenty-six of us stand in a line, and every book ever written is just us, rearranged. What am I?","alphabet",B.k,"It starts with A.")
B.acH=new A.m(71,"\u265f\ufe0f","I am a war on sixty-four squares where the queen does the fighting and the king mostly hides. What am I?","chess",B.k,"Checkmate ends it.")
B.a9i=new A.m(72,"\u2709\ufe0f","I wear a stamp and carry words across the world, but I never read a single one of them. What am I?","envelope",B.k,"Lick it, seal it, post it.")
B.aaM=new A.m(73,"\ud83e\udd27","I arrive without warning, I shut your eyes for you, and strangers bless you when I am done. What am I?","sneeze",B.k,"Pepper brings it on.")
B.acO=new A.m(74,"\ud83e\uddc2","I come from the sea and from the mountain alike, and a pinch of me is the difference between dinner and disaster. What am I?","salt",B.k,"The shaker beside the pepper.")
B.abD=new A.m(75,"\ud83c\udf6f","A thousand workers made me, a bear would rob a tree for me, and I am the one food that never goes off. What am I?","honey",B.k,"Spread it on toast, or stir it into tea.")
B.ac4=new A.m(76,"\ud83c\udf31","I hold a whole tree inside something smaller than your fingernail \u2014 but only if you bury me first. What am I?","seed",B.k,"Plant it and wait.")
B.a8U=new A.m(77,"\ud83e\udeba","I am a house with no door, built from twigs by a mother with no hands. What am I?","nest",B.k,"Look up into the tree in spring.")
B.abV=new A.m(78,"\ud83e\uddf6","I was a coat before I was ever a jumper. What am I?","wool",B.k,"A sheep gave it up.")
B.a90=new A.m(79,"\ud83e\udee7","I am born of soap and breath, I show you a rainbow for one second, and I die the moment you touch me. What am I?","bubble",B.k,"Blow them through a little ring.")
B.a1c=s(["seashell"],t.s)
B.a9_=new A.m(80,"\ud83d\udc1a","The sea left its voice inside me \u2014 hold me to your ear and listen. What am I?","shell",B.a1c,"Picked up along the beach.")
B.Z_=s(["daybreak","morning"],t.s)
B.aag=new A.m(81,"\ud83c\udf04","I am the day's first breath, and the rooster gets all the credit for me. What am I?","sunrise",B.Z_,"The opposite of sunset.")
B.ada=new A.m(82,"\ud83d\ude34","Everyone spends a third of their life doing me and remembers almost none of it. What am I?","sleep",B.k,"Eight hours a night, if you are lucky.")
B.ad4=new A.m(83,"\ud83e\udea2","Pull me tighter and I hold on harder; a sailor ties me and a magician makes me vanish. What am I?","knot",B.k,"In a shoelace, or a tangled necklace.")
B.abL=new A.m(84,"\ud83d\udc8d","I have no beginning and no end, and on the right finger I mean a promise. What am I?","ring",B.k,"On the fourth finger, at a wedding.")
B.a9k=new A.m(85,"\ud83c\udf35","I live where nothing else can, I drink once a year, and I hug back with a thousand needles. What am I?","cactus",B.k,"A desert plant on the windowsill.")
B.aar=new A.m(86,"\ud83d\udc45","I live in a cage of teeth, I am always wet, and I get you into trouble faster than anything else you own. What am I?","tongue",B.k,"Stick it out for the doctor.")
B.a1u=s(["tear","teardrop"],t.s)
B.acn=new A.m(87,"\ud83d\ude22","I am salt water that comes from you, on the saddest days and the happiest ones alike. What am I?","tears",B.a1u,"Onions bring them on too.")
B.aaP=new A.m(88,"\ud83c\udf4e","I pull every apple to the ground and keep your feet on the earth, and you have never once seen me. What am I?","gravity",B.k,"Newton sat under a tree and named it.")
B.a0x=s(["oxygen"],t.s)
B.ace=new A.m(89,"\ud83d\udca8","You cannot see me or hold me, but three minutes without me and you are gone. What am I?","air",B.a0x,"Take a deep breath of it.")
B.aa4=new A.m(90,"\ud83e\udd23","I am told but never sold; get me and you laugh, miss me and you groan. What am I?","joke",B.k,"Knock, knock.")
B.acy=new A.m(91,"\u2753","I always end with a little hook, and I am nothing at all without an answer. What am I?","question",B.k,"The last mark on this sentence?")
B.a94=new A.m(92,"\ud83d\udc43","I stand in the middle of your face, and I can run without any legs. What am I?","nose",B.k,"Between your eyes and your mouth.")
B.Wp=s(["sand timer","egg timer"],t.s)
B.ade=new A.m(93,"\u23f3","Turn me on my head and I start all over again; I hold a beach and measure time with it. What am I?","hourglass",B.Wp,"Grains run from the top bulb to the bottom.")
B.abz=new A.m(94,"\ud83d\udc8e","I was coal once, I am the hardest thing you will ever hold, and I can cut glass. What am I?","diamond",B.k,"On an engagement ring.")
B.acT=new A.m(95,"\ud83c\udf82","You have had one every year of your life, and you cannot remember the first. What am I?","birthday",B.k,"Cake, candles and a song.")
B.acI=new A.m(96,"\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f","I am a beach that lost its sea. What am I?","desert",B.k,"Camels cross it.")
B.ab0=new A.m(97,"\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f","Water on every side of me, and I never once get wet. What am I?","island",B.k,"You need a boat to reach it.")
B.a0O=s(["planet","world"],t.s)
B.aaN=new A.m(98,"\ud83c\udf0d","I am a ball that has been spinning for four billion years, and you have never fallen off. What am I?","earth",B.a0O,"The third rock from the sun.")
B.a07=s(["memories"],t.s)
B.acs=new A.m(99,"\ud83e\udde0","I keep everything you have lost and lose the things you would most like to keep. What am I?","memory",B.a07,"Elephants are said to have a long one.")
B.abx=new A.m(100,"\ud83d\udede","I was the best idea anyone ever had, and I have been going round in circles ever since. What am I?","wheel",B.k,"Four of them under every car.")
B.a8I=new A.m(101,"\ud83e\udd98","I carry my baby in a pocket, I cross the outback in great bounds, and I cannot walk backwards. What am I?","kangaroo",B.k,"It boxes, and it lives in Australia.")
B.aby=new A.m(102,"\u2328\ufe0f","I have keys that open no locks, space but no room, and you can enter without going inside. What am I?","keyboard",B.k,"You type on it.")
B.ad2=new A.m(103,"\ud83e\ude9f","I am a hole in the wall that nobody walks through, and I let the whole street look in. What am I?","window",B.k,"Curtains hang in front of it.")
B.acG=new A.m(104,"\ud83d\ude2e\u200d\ud83d\udca8","I am lighter than a feather, yet the strongest person alive cannot hold me for more than a few minutes. What am I?","breath",B.k,"Hold it underwater.")
B.ZB=s(["flu"],t.s)
B.ac_=new A.m(105,"\ud83e\udd27","You can catch me without chasing me, but you can never throw me back. What am I?","cold",B.ZB,"It comes with a runny nose.")
B.ac8=new A.m(106,"\ud83e\udde6","I come in pairs, I hide in your shoes, and the washing machine always swallows one of me. What am I?","sock",B.k,"You pull it on before your trainers.")
B.acb=new A.m(107,"\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f","I have a tail and I scurry around your desk, yet no cat has ever chased me. What am I?","mouse",B.k,"Click, click.")
B.abB=new A.m(108,"\u2b50","I was in the sky all day long, but you only notice me once the sun has gone. What am I?","star",B.k,"Twinkle, twinkle.")
B.a8K=new A.m(109,"\ud83d\udcc5","I have plenty of dates but have never been out on one, and my days are numbered. What am I?","calendar",B.k,"It hangs on the wall with twelve pages.")
B.aaw=new A.m(110,"\ud83d\udc5b","I get fat on payday and thin by the end of the month, and I live in your pocket. What am I?","wallet",B.k,"Notes and cards live inside.")
B.a99=new A.m(111,"\ud83d\udd28","I only get to work when I hit something on the head. What am I?","hammer",B.k,"It drives in nails.")
B.abs=new A.m(112,"\ud83e\uddc4","I come in cloves but I am no spice rack, and vampires cross the street to avoid me. What am I?","garlic",B.k,"It makes your breath strong.")
B.a_V=s(["lime"],t.s)
B.abX=new A.m(113,"\ud83c\udf4b","Squeeze me and I make faces pucker, yet with sugar and water I am a summer favourite. What am I?","lemon",B.a_V,"Yellow and sour.")
B.abH=new A.m(114,"\ud83d\udcf7","I capture you in a flash without laying a finger on you. What am I?","camera",B.k,"Say cheese.")
B.a93=new A.m(115,"\ud83e\uddfc","The more I work, the smaller I get, and I leave you cleaner every time. What am I?","soap",B.k,"It slips out of wet hands.")
B.a1v=s(["teeth"],t.s)
B.a9b=new A.m(116,"\ud83e\uddb7","I am white, I chew all your food, and when I fall out a fairy pays for me. What am I?","tooth",B.a1v,"A dentist looks after it.")
B.a1w=s(["telephone","mobile"],t.s)
B.a8Z=new A.m(117,"\u260e\ufe0f","I ring without a finger and speak without a mouth, and you hold me to your ear. What am I?","phone",B.a1w,"Hello? Who is this?")
B.a9g=new A.m(118,"\ud83d\udd14","I have a tongue but taste nothing; swing me and I sing. What am I?","bell",B.k,"It hangs in a church tower.")
B.a9j=new A.m(119,"\ud83d\udeaa","I have a knob but no nose, and I am not myself when I am ajar. What am I?","door",B.k,"Knock on it.")
B.adc=new A.m(120,"\u26fa","I am a house you can roll up and carry on your back. What am I?","tent",B.k,"Campers sleep in it.")
B.a9H=new A.m(121,"\ud83e\udd87","I hang upside down all day and at night I find my way with my ears. What am I?","bat",B.k,"Not a bird, but it flies.")
B.abC=new A.m(122,"\ud83e\udd89","All night long I ask the same question and never wait for an answer. What am I?","owl",B.k,"Who? Who?")
B.ac5=new A.m(123,"\ud83d\udc2b","I carry my own lunch on my back and cross the sand for days without a drink. What am I?","camel",B.k,"Ship of the desert.")
B.a2q=s(["zip"],t.s)
B.adg=new A.m(124,"\ud83e\udd10","I have teeth that never bite, and I close your coat with a single pull. What am I?","zipper",B.a2q,"It runs up the front of a jacket.")
B.YJ=s(["chili","pepper"],t.s)
B.aaV=new A.m(125,"\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f","I am green or red, I am hot but never warm, and I make your eyes water at dinner. What am I?","chilli",B.YJ,"Spicy!")
B.ab1=new A.m(126,"\ud83c\udf5e","I rise without an alarm, I am kneaded by hand, and I come by the loaf. What am I?","bread",B.k,"Toast starts as this.")
B.Yw=s(["biscuit"],t.s)
B.ad_=new A.m(127,"\ud83c\udf6a","I crumble when you break me, I hide in a jar, and I love being dunked in milk. What am I?","cookie",B.Yw,"Chocolate chip is a favourite.")
B.aaE=new A.m(128,"\ud83c\udf33","I have bark but never bite, rings but no fingers, and a trunk but no luggage. What am I?","tree",B.k,"Leaves grow on it.")
B.aaj=new A.m(129,"\u2764\ufe0f","I beat all day without winning a fight, and people break me without touching me. What am I?","heart",B.k,"It is shaped on every valentine.")
B.a8D=new A.m(130,"\ud83d\udc1f","I have scales but weigh nothing, and I sleep with my eyes open. What am I?","fish",B.k,"It lives in the sea.")
B.a8Y=new A.m(131,"\ud83e\udd55","I am orange, I grow upside down in the dirt, and a snowman wears me as a nose. What am I?","carrot",B.k,"Rabbits love it.")
B.ZA=s(["fiddle"],t.s)
B.a9B=new A.m(132,"\ud83c\udfbb","I have a bow but no arrow, strings but no puppet, and I sing when you tickle me. What am I?","violin",B.ZA,"Tucked under the chin.")
B.abp=new A.m(133,"\ud83e\uddf9","I sweep but I am not a wind, and I stand in the corner when I am done. What am I?","broom",B.k,"A witch rides one.")
B.acu=new A.m(134,"\u26a1","I strike but never hit a ball, I flash but take no photos, and I come before the boom. What am I?","lightning",B.k,"Seen in a storm.")
B.add=new A.m(135,"\u2600\ufe0f","I get up before you do and go to bed on the other side of the sky, and you must never stare at me. What am I?","sun",B.k,"It gives us day.")
B.a9E=new A.m(136,"\ud83c\udf83","I am round and orange, and once a year people carve a face into me and put a light inside. What am I?","pumpkin",B.k,"Halloween.")
B.Yv=s(["bike","cycle"],t.s)
B.aca=new A.m(137,"\ud83d\udeb2","I have two wheels, a bell and a chain, but I only move while you pedal. What am I?","bicycle",B.Yv,"Mind the gears.")
B.ac7=new A.m(138,"\ud83e\udeb6","I am light enough to float, I help a bird to fly, and one of me can tickle you. What am I?","feather",B.k,"Pillows are stuffed with them.")
B.abn=new A.m(139,"\u2702\ufe0f","I have two legs and two eyes, and I cut but I am not a knife. What am I?","scissors",B.k,"Paper beats rock, but not me.")
B.a0R=s(["puppy"],t.s)
B.aaK=new A.m(140,"\ud83d\udc15","I wag at the door when you come home, and I am called your best friend. What am I?","dog",B.a0R,"Woof!")
B.a1B=s(["tortoise"],t.s)
B.a8L=new A.m(141,"\ud83d\udc22","I carry my house on my back wherever I go, and I once beat a hare in a race. What am I?","turtle",B.a1B,"Slow and steady.")
B.aak=new A.m(142,"\ud83c\udf4c","I come in a bunch, I wear a yellow jacket, and you peel me before you eat me. What am I?","banana",B.k,"Monkeys love it.")
B.abg=new A.m(143,"\ud83c\udf4e","One of me a day keeps the doctor away. What am I?","apple",B.k,"It fell on Newton.")
B.a9W=new A.m(144,"\ud83c\udf49","I am green outside, red inside, dotted with black, and I am mostly water. What am I?","watermelon",B.k,"A summer fruit with seeds to spit.")
B.abr=new A.m(145,"\ud83d\ude80","I count backwards before I leave, and I leave in fire for the stars. What am I?","rocket",B.k,"Three, two, one, lift-off.")
B.a9e=new A.m(146,"\ud83c\udf55","I am round when I arrive in a square box, and I am eaten in triangles. What am I?","pizza",B.k,"Cheese and tomato on a crust.")
B.ab4=new A.m(147,"\ud83c\udf74","I have teeth but never chew, and I sit on the left of your plate. What am I?","fork",B.k,"It pairs with a knife.")
B.a8A=new A.m(148,"\ud83d\udc51","I sit on a head and rule nothing myself, yet whoever wears me rules everything. What am I?","crown",B.k,"A king wears it.")
B.a_6=s(["hill"],t.s)
B.abR=new A.m(149,"\u26f0\ufe0f","I have a peak but no hat, a foot but no shoe, and climbers try to stand on my head. What am I?","mountain",B.a_6,"Everest is the tallest.")
B.a1i=s(["spectacles","specs"],t.s)
B.a9K=new A.m(150,"\ud83d\udc53","I have two glass eyes but see nothing myself; I ride on your nose so that you can see. What am I?","glasses",B.a1i,"Reading gets blurry without them.")
